Command	                 Purpose
Connect-VIServer	       Connects to vCenter
Get-VM	                 Retrieves virtual machines
Get-Snapshot	           Retrieves snapshots
Created	                 Snapshot creation date
AddHours(-74)	Calculates 74-hour cutoff
Disconnect-VIServer      	Disconnects from vCenter

Important: This is a read-only script. It identifies snapshots older than 74 hours, but does not remove them.
